WEBVTT

00:02:28.468 --> 00:02:30.893
for adventure, for novelty,

00:02:30.917 --> 00:02:34.028
for mystery, for risk, for danger,

00:02:34.052 --> 00:02:37.318
for the unknown,
for the unexpected, surprise --

00:02:37.342 --> 00:02:39.249
you get the gist.

00:02:39.273 --> 00:02:40.873
For journey, for travel.

00:02:41.248 --> 00:02:44.773
So reconciling our need for security
and our need for adventure

00:02:44.797 --> 00:02:46.347
into one relationship,

00:02:46.371 --> 00:02:49.230
or what we today like to call
a passionate marriage,

00:02:49.254 --> 00:02:51.512
used to be a contradiction in terms.

00:02:51.948 --> 00:02:55.226
Marriage was an economic institution

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:58.288
in which you were
given a partnership for life

00:02:58.312 --> 00:03:01.032
in terms of children and social status